 "name": "vehicle.handling/cars",
 "template": "vehicle.handling",
 "about": "Proving runs for each model in turn, the player driving alone, on Downtown's north-south arterial (level dry asphalt) and in the parking lot north-east of the plaza: 0-60 km/h at full throttle; a full stop from 60 km/h, dry and then in rain; the handbrake alone from 40 km/h; the turning circle at 8 km/h with full lock. Each model's body is a physics body on the vehicles layer with its listed mass. Traffic and people are set to none for the runs, and the wet stop uses the dry stop's lane. (Top speed needs a straight of at least 1.5 km, which Downtown does not have.)",
